        "content": "TRACEABILITY_JSON={\"status\":\"READY\",\"unresolved\":[],\"undefined_symbols\":[],\"requirements_mapped\":[\"copertura delle dieci zone -> vincoli di copertura\",\"doppia copertura di Z3 e Z7 -> requisiti r_Z3=r_Z7=2\",\"apertura di al massimo cinque centri -> vincolo di cardinalità\",\"minimizzazione dei costi di apertura -> funzione obiettivo\",\"decisione di apertura dei centri -> variabili binarie x_j\"]}\n\n## Insiemi, parametri e variabili decisionali\n\n**Insiemi**\n\n- Centri:\n  \\[\n  J=\\{A,B,C,D,E,F,G,H\\}.\n  \\]\n- Zone:\n  \\[\n  I=\\{Z1,Z2,Z3,Z4,Z5,Z6,Z7,Z8,Z9,Z10\\}.\n  \\]\n- Centri che possono coprire ciascuna zona:\n  \\[\n  \\begin{aligned}\n  N_{Z1}&=\\{A,C\\}, & N_{Z2}&=\\{A,B\\},\\\\\n  N_{Z3}&=\\{A,B,D\\}, & N_{Z4}&=\\{B,E\\},\\\\\n  N_{Z5}&=\\{B,C,F\\}, & N_{Z6}&=\\{C,D,G\\},\\\\\n  N_{Z7}&=\\{D,E,H\\}, & N_{Z8}&=\\{E,F,H\\},\\\\\n  N_{Z9}&=\\{F,G\\}, & N_{Z10}&=\\{G,H\\}.\n  \\end{aligned}\n  \\]\n\n**Parametri**\n\n- Costi di apertura:\n  \\[\n  (c_A,c_B,c_C,c_D,c_E,c_F,c_G,c_H)\n  =(24,20,27,22,25,19,23,21).\n  \\]\n- Copertura richiesta:\n  \\[\n  r_i=\n  \\begin{cases}\n  2 & i\\in\\{Z3,Z7\\},\\\\\n  1 & \\text{altrimenti}.\n  \\end{cases}\n  \\]\n- Numero massimo di centri apribili:\n  \\[\n  K=5.\n  \\]\n\n**Variabili decisionali**\n\n\\[\nx_j=\n\\begin{cases}\n1 & \\text{se il centro }j\\text{ viene aperto},\\\\\n0 & \\text{altrimenti},\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad j\\in J.\n\\]\n\n## Formulazione matematica completa\n\n### Funzione obiettivo\n\n\\[\n\\min\\quad\n24x_A+20x_B+27x_C+22x_D+25x_E+19x_F+23x_G+21x_H.\n\\]\n\n### Vincoli di copertura\n\n\\[\n\\sum_{j\\in N_i}x_j\\ge r_i\n\\qquad \\forall i\\in I.\n\\]\n\nEsplicitamente:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{aligned}\nx_A+x_C &\\ge 1 &&(Z1),\\\\\nx_A+x_B &\\ge 1 &&(Z2),\\\\\nx_A+x_B+x_D &\\ge 2 &&(Z3),\\\\\nx_B+x_E &\\ge 1 &&(Z4),\\\\\nx_B+x_C+x_F &\\ge 1 &&(Z5),\\\\\nx_C+x_D+x_G &\\ge 1 &&(Z6),\\\\\nx_D+x_E+x_H &\\ge 2 &&(Z7),\\\\\nx_E+x_F+x_H &\\ge 1 &&(Z8),\\\\\nx_F+x_G &\\ge 1 &&(Z9),\\\\\nx_G+x_H &\\ge 1 &&(Z10).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\]\n\n### Limite sul numero di centri\n\n\\[\nx_A+x_B+x_C+x_D+x_E+x_F+x_G+x_H\\le 5.\n\\]\n\n### Dominio\n\n\\[\nx_j\\in\\{0,1\\}\n\\qquad \\forall j\\in J.\n\\]\n\n```python\nimport gurobipy as gp\nfrom gurobipy import GRB\nimport json\n\ncenters = [\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\", \"E\", \"F\", \"G\", \"H\"]\nzones = [\"Z1\", \"Z2\", \"Z3\", \"Z4\", \"Z5\", \"Z6\", \"Z7\", \"Z8\", \"Z9\", \"Z10\"]\n\ncost = {\n    \"A\": 24,\n    \"B\": 20,\n    \"C\": 27,\n    \"D\": 22,\n    \"E\": 25,\n    \"F\": 19,\n    \"G\": 23,\n    \"H\": 21\n}\n\ncoverage = {\n    \"Z1\": [\"A\", \"C\"],\n    \"Z2\": [\"A\", \"B\"],\n    \"Z3\": [\"A\", \"B\", \"D\"],\n    \"Z4\": [\"B\", \"E\"],\n    \"Z5\": [\"B\", \"C\", \"F\"],\n    \"Z6\": [\"C\", \"D\", \"G\"],\n    \"Z7\": [\"D\", \"E\", \"H\"],\n    \"Z8\": [\"E\", \"F\", \"H\"],\n    \"Z9\": [\"F\", \"G\"],\n    \"Z10\": [\"G\", \"H\"]\n}\n\nrequired_coverage = {\n    zone: 2 if zone in [\"Z3\", \"Z7\"] else 1\n    for zone in zones\n}\n\nmax_open_centers = 5\n\nenv = gp.Env(empty=True)\nenv.setParam(\"OutputFlag\", 0)\nenv.start()\n\nmodel = gp.Model(\"copertura_zone\", env=env)\n\nx = {\n    center: model.addVar(vtype=GRB.BINARY, name=\"x_\" + center)\n    for center in centers\n}\n\nmodel.setObjective(\n    gp.quicksum(cost[center] * x[center] for center in centers),\n    GRB.MINIMIZE\n)\n\nfor zone in zones:\n    model.addConstr(\n        gp.quicksum(x[center] for center in coverage[zone])\n        >= required_coverage[zone],\n        name=\"coverage_\" + zone\n    )\n\nmodel.addConstr(\n    gp.quicksum(x[center] for center in centers) <= max_open_centers,\n    name=\"max_open_centers\"\n)\n\nmodel.optimize()\n\nstatus_names = {\n    1: \"LOADED\",\n    2: \"OPTIMAL\",\n    3: \"INFEASIBLE\",\n    4: \"INF_OR_UNBD\",\n    5: \"UNBOUNDED\",\n    6: \"CUTOFF\",\n    7: \"ITERATION_LIMIT\",\n    8: \"NODE_LIMIT\",\n    9: \"TIME_LIMIT\",\n    10: \"SOLUTION_LIMIT\",\n    11: \"INTERRUPTED\",\n    12: \"NUMERIC\",\n    13: \"SUBOPTIMAL\",\n    14: \"INPROGRESS\",\n    15: \"USER_OBJ_LIMIT\",\n    16: \"WORK_LIMIT\",\n    17: \"MEM_LIMIT\"\n}\n\nsolver_status = status_names.get(model.Status, \"STATUS_\" + str(model.Status))\n\nif model.Status == GRB.OPTIMAL:\n    variable_values = {}\n    for center in centers:\n        value = x[center].X\n        if abs(value - round(value)) <= 1e-9:\n            value = float(round(value))\n        else:\n            value = float(value)\n        variable_values[\"x_\" + center] = value\n\n    result = {\n        \"status\": \"OPTIMAL\",\n        \"objective\": float(model.ObjVal),\n        \"variables\": variable_values\n    }\nelse:\n    result = {\n        \"status\": solver_status,\n        \"objective\": None,\n        \"variables\": {}\n    }\n\nmodel.dispose()\nenv.dispose()\n\nprint(\"SOLUTION_JSON=\" + json.dumps(result, separators=(\",\", \":\")))\n```\n\n## Sintesi della soluzione\n\nLo stato è **OPTIMAL** e il costo minimo è **106**. I centri aperti sono:\n\n\\[\nx_A=x_B=x_D=x_F=x_H=1,\n\\]\n\nmentre \\(x_C=x_E=x_G=0\\). Le cinque aperture coprono tutte le zone e garantiscono la doppia copertura richiesta per \\(Z3\\) e \\(Z7\\).",
